# What ships in the Composer package is what a consumer's application can
# actually use: src/, docs/, and the licence. Everything else is for people
# working *in* this repository.
#
# The skills are the clearest case. add-route/SKILL.md points at
# tests/RoutingTest.php and describes this repository's layout — in someone
# else's vendor/ directory that path does not exist and the instruction is
# worse than absent. Contributors still get them from the git checkout.
/.github        export-ignore
/.opencode      export-ignore
/tests          export-ignore
/.editorconfig  export-ignore
/phpunit.xml    export-ignore
